      "is": "IS 4962:1968",
      "clause": "2",
      "title": "Types and Sizes",
      "text": "2. Types and Sizes — Classified in accordance with mode of sliding of panels into the frame unit. Types 1 to 5 give clear opening, while Types 6 and 7 need no space at the sides. Overall size of door shall be such as to cover modular opening completely. Note - For   typical arrangement of panels of side sliding door see Fig. 2 of the standard.",
